  "body": "Welcome to 21 Wira Lane, where contemporary design meets lifestyle excellence in the heart of Silverdale, one of the Hibiscus Coast’s most desirable neighbourhoods. Discover a new standard of comfort, convenience, and long-term value, perfectly tailored for modern families. Covered by 10-Year Stamford New Build Insurance for complete peace of mind.\r\n\r\nEvery detail of these stunning brick and weatherboard cedar homes has been thoughtfully curated, blending timeless style with practical functionality. Step inside and experience the space, flexibility, and comfort you’ve been searching for.\r\n\r\nHighlights Include:\r\n\r\n• Four Bedrooms – Including a versatile downstairs bedroom and bathroom, ideal for guests, extended family, or your dream home office.\r\n• Master Suite – Enjoy your own retreat with a walk-in wardrobe and a sleek, private ensuite.\r\n• Living & Dining Space – The perfect haven for movie nights, relaxation, and quality family time.\r\n• Modern Kitchen – Featuring high-end appliances and premium finishes, ready for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n• Year-Round Comfort – Double glazing, air conditioning, underfloor heating, digital door lock, and energy-efficient LED lighting.\r\n• Internal Access Garage & Off-Street Parking – Convenience and security for today’s busy lifestyles.\r\n• Top School Zones – Zoned for Dairy Flat School and Orewa College, with Silverdale Mall, motorway access, beautiful beaches, and essential amenities just minutes away.\r\n\r\nThis home offers exceptional space and functionality—features often missing in many modern builds. Each residence is designed with your family’s comfort and needs in mind, ensuring everyday living is both effortless and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing or join us at our open home. Your new chapter starts here—secure your place in Silverdale’s premier community!",
